HKCR,CLSID\{a2a9545d-a0c2-42b4-9708-a0b2badd77c8}\InprocServer32,,,ole32.dll
HKCR,CLSID\{a2a9545d-a0c2-42b4-9708-a0b2badd77c8}\InprocServer32,ThreadingModel,,Apartment

